*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*       FORM !SCREENLOOP                                              *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*       Dynamische Dynpro-Modifikation                                *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM screenloop USING loesch.

  MOVE dyn TO varc30.

  DO 4 TIMES.
    IF varc30(3) <> space.
      MOVE sy-index TO i.
    ENDIF.
    SHIFT varc30 BY 3 PLACES.
  ENDDO.

  LOOP AT SCREEN.

    CLEAR subrc.

    IF dyn-spalte1 <> space OR dyn-spalte2 <> space.

      CHECK: screen-name = dyn-spalte1
          OR screen-name = dyn-spalte2.
      MOVE int4 TO subrc.

    ELSE.

      CHECK:    screen-group1 <> space
             OR screen-group2 <> space
             OR screen-group3 <> space
             OR screen-group4 <> space.

      MOVE dyn TO varc30.
      DO i TIMES.
        IF varc30(3) <> space.
          CASE sy-index.
            WHEN 1.
              ASSIGN screen-group1 TO <f>.
            WHEN 2.
              ASSIGN screen-group2 TO <f>.
            WHEN 3.
              ASSIGN screen-group3 TO <f>.
            WHEN 4.
              ASSIGN screen-group4 TO <f>.
          ENDCASE.

          IF varc30(1) = '!' AND <f> <> space.
            subrc = int4.
          ENDIF.
          IF varc30(1) <> '!' AND <f> CA varc30(3).
            subrc = int4.
          ENDIF.
        ENDIF.
        SHIFT varc30 BY 3 PLACES.
      ENDDO.

    ENDIF.

    CHECK subrc = int4.

    IF NOT dyn-invisible IS INITIAL.
      MOVE: dyn-invisible TO screen-invisible,
            0             TO screen-output,
            0             TO screen-input.
    ENDIF.

    IF NOT dyn-input IS INITIAL.
      MOVE dyn-input TO screen-input.
    ENDIF.

    IF NOT dyn-output IS INITIAL.
      MOVE dyn-output TO screen-output.
    ENDIF.

    IF NOT dyn-intensified IS INITIAL.
      MOVE dyn-intensified TO screen-intensified.
    ENDIF.

    IF NOT dyn-required IS INITIAL.
      MOVE dyn-required TO screen-required.
    ENDIF.

    IF NOT dyn-length IS INITIAL.
      MOVE dyn-length TO screen-length.
    ENDIF.

    MODIFY SCREEN.

  ENDLOOP.

  CHECK loesch = on.
  CLEAR dyn.

ENDFORM.                    "SCREENLOOP


