      PERFORM vcopy_dyn_mgr_pop_start.

    WHEN 'CJZ1'.
*-----Projekte: Popup Vorgangsauswahl
      PERFORM vcopy_dyn_mgr_pop_start.

    WHEN 'CJZ2'.
*-----Projekte: Popup Zeitraum
      PERFORM vcopy_dyn_mgr_pop_start.

    WHEN 'CJZ3'.
*-----Projekte: Popup Kopiermodus
      PERFORM vcopy_dyn_mgr_pop_start.

  ENDCASE.

