*     perform  vcopy_dyn_fm_mgr_delete.                     "KI4K012083
      PERFORM  vcopy_dyn_fm_mgr_delete USING off.           "KI4K012083

    WHEN 'FMP2'.
*-----Aktion "Finanzplan   Version loeschen " ausfuehren
*     perform  vcopy_dyn_fp_mgr_delete.                    "KI4K012083
      PERFORM  vcopy_dyn_fp_mgr_delete USING off.           "KI4K012083

    WHEN 'CJ9B'.
