      PERFORM vcopy_dyn_cj_mgr_proc_copy.

    WHEN 'CJ9C'.
*-----Projekte kopieren - Erloesplanung
      PERFORM vcopy_dyn_cj_mgr_proc_copy.

    WHEN space.                                             "KI4K012083
      CASE sy-tcode.                                        "KI4K012083
