          PERFORM  vcopy_dyn_fm_mgr_enq USING on on.        "KI4K012083
        WHEN 'FM9E'.                                        "KI4K012083
          PERFORM  vcopy_dyn_fm_mgr_enq USING off on.       "KI4K012083
        WHEN 'FM9F'.                                        "KI4K012083
